{"meta":{"format_version":"5.0","model_format":"free","box_uv":false},"name":"deer","model_identifier":"deer","visible_box":[1,1,0],"variable_placeholders":"","multi_file_ruleset":"","variable_placeholder_buttons":[],"timeline_setups":[],"unhandled_root_fields":{"description":"# deer\n\nRed deer (B9), 1.1 m at the shoulder (39 u); stag with antlers to about 1.9 m (67 u).\n\nSlender red-brown deer with pale rump patch and short tail, long thin legs, upright neck and head (pre-tilted cubes), and branching antlers (beam, brow, mid and crown tines of thin cubes) in their own `antlers` group on the head.\n\n- Cubes: 30 (all unrotated unless noted). Texture 128x128, 1 px per unit, embedded.\n- Rest bounds (body, no held items): x -6.5..6.5, y 0.0..65.5, z -34.7..18.5 (faces -Z).\n\n## Hit box\n\n- body box 11 x 39 x 36 (w x h x d) centred on x = 0, z = -1, from y = 0; head and neck to y = 55 (antlers to 67), z = -40\n\n## Clips\n\n| clip | length (s) | loop | notes |\n|---|---|---|---|\n| `idle` | 4 | loop | breathing, head turns, ear and tail flicks |\n| `walk` | 0.9 | loop | 4-beat walk |\n| `run` | 0.42 | loop | gallop |\n| `bound_away` | 0.62 | loop | leaping bound when fleeing, tail raised (flight phases by design) |\n| `graze` | 4.5 | loop | muzzle on the grass, one front step (loop) |\n| `alert` | 1.6 | once | head snaps up, tail up, looks around (0.3 / 0.9 s), the cue before bound_away |\n| `injured` | 0.6 | once | flinch back |\n| `death` | 1.4 | hold | falls onto its right side, holds; rests on y = 0 |\n| `mate` | 2.0 | loop | Patch 5: a gentle nuzzle toward the partner on the model's left (head and neck turn, body sway, tail wag; birds fluff their wings, the hare hops), played by two animals side by side while the game draws hearts over them. |\n\n## Move speeds (in-place cycles; stride matched to these)\n\n- `walk`: 46.2 u/s (1.3 m/s), cycle 0.9 s, 42 u per cycle\n- `run`: 320.0 u/s (9.0 m/s), cycle 0.42 s, 134 u per cycle\n- `bound_away`: 248.9 u/s (7.0 m/s), cycle 0.62 s, 154 u per cycle\n\n## Attachment points (empty groups, pivot in model units)\n\n\n## Variant textures (same UV layout)\n\n- `deer_hind.png`: female texture: lighter, plain coat; hide the `antlers` group for hinds\n- `deer_young.png`: calf (fawn) texture with pale spots (use at half scale, hide `antlers`)\n\n## Notes\n\n- Stag = default model. For hinds and calves the game hides the `antlers` group (8 cubes) and uses the variant texture.\n- Antler, neck and head cubes carry fixed cube rotations; everything else is unrotated.\n- Runs away when attacked; gives meat and hide."},"resolution":{"width":128,"height":128},"elements":[{"name":"barrel","box_uv":false,"render_order":"default","locked":false,"export":true,"scope":0,"allow_mirror_modeling":true,"from":[-5,24,-15],"to":[5,36,12],"autouv":0,"color":0,"origin":[0,32,0],"faces":{"north":{"uv":[27,41,37,53],"texture":0},"east":{"uv":[100,27,127,39],"texture":0},"south":{"uv":[37,41,47,53],"texture":0},"west":{"uv":[0,41,27,53],"texture":0},"up":{"uv":[0,0,10,27],"texture":0},"down":{"uv":[10,0,20,27],"texture":0}},"type":"cube","uuid":"69ddd57b-66ec-5e58-b00a-86cbe33f50cf"},{"name":"chest","box_uv":false,"render_order":"default","locked":false,"export":true,"scope":0,"allow_mirror_modeling":true,"from":[-4.5,22,-19],"to":[4.5,35,-14],"autouv":0,"color":0,"origin":[0,32,0],"faces":{"north":{"uv":[38,27,47,40],"texture":0},"east":{"uv":[70,27,75,40],"texture":0},"south":{"uv":[47,27,56,40],"texture":0},"west":{"uv":[75,27,80,40],"texture":0},"up":{"uv":[76,53,85,58],"texture":0},"down":{"uv":[85,53,94,58],"texture":0}},"type":"cube","uuid":"0c5aa2e0-8bdc-5999-9b7b-842411edda9a"},{"name":"withers","box_uv":false,"render_order":"default","locked":false,"export":true,"scope":0,"allow_mirror_modeling":true,"from":[-3.5,34,-16],"to":[3.5,39,-8],"autouv":0,"color":0,"origin":[0,32,0],"faces":{"north":{"uv":[110,53,117,58],"texture":0},"east":{"uv":[94,53,102,58],"texture":0},"south":{"uv":[117,53,124,58],"textu